  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 418903,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The 'branded hashtag challenge' feature on TikTok could have allowed anyone that had been partnered with an account manager to request a TikTok video ID and view the accompanying video. If the ID of a private TikTok video was known and sent, the user would have been shown the private video of another creator. This has been fully remediated. We thank @dxcoder for reporting this to our team. ",
      "updated_at": "2024-03-20T01:24:49.265Z",
